-- ============================================================================
-- v1393: Seed / sample data — IT Requirements (requirements, use cases, specifications)
-- ============================================================================
-- PRD / plan v1338, Slice 10 — decision D11 (rule 18.2). Platform and Simulator.
--   Platform  — project SEED334-PRJ-08 (fictional Northbridge Bank technology programme):
--     public.requirements_register        60 requirements (…-4000-a023-…): 12 business, 22 functional,
--                                         20 non-functional (2 in each of the 10 areas), 2 technical,
--                                         3 regulatory, 1 other — with owner, rationale, verification.
--     Use Cases (ict_use_cases)           10 records (…-4000-a024-…), main / alternative flows as steps.
--     Requirements Specification          10 records (…-4000-a025-…), one per delivery slice, BRD / FRS
--                                         alternating; the closed Regulatory slice is Superseded.
--   Simulator — practice project SEED592-PP-01: the same 60 requirements in sim.requirements_register
--     (…-4000-a026-…), 10 use cases (…-a027-…) and 10 specifications (…-a028-…).
-- Requirement codes and display IDs are blank: Admin ID Generation assigns them (rule 16.2; Simulator
-- codes need Admin v245 + v1392). Vendor-neutral (rule 26). Idempotent (ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING) —
-- rows that already exist, including anything edited by users, are never overwritten.
-- Prerequisites: v1355, v1384, v1386, v1387, v1392, Admin v245.
-- ============================================================================

-- ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-- PLATFORM — SEED334-PRJ-08
-- ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
WITH proj AS (
  SELECT id FROM public.projects WHERE project_code = 'SEED334-PRJ-08' LIMIT 1
)
