  ('00000000-0000-4000-a023-000000000004', 'Loans keep their schedule and arrears history', 'Each loan keeps its repayment schedule, balance and days in arrears after migration.', 'business', 'must', 'draft', 'Loan balance agrees to the legacy balance to the cent
