  ('00000000-0000-4000-a023-000000000005', 'Branches serve customers on day one', 'Branch staff can open, enquire on and service accounts from the first business day without the legacy screens.', 'business', 'must', 'approved', 'A trained teller completes the ten most common tasks in UAT
