  ('00000000-0000-4000-a026-000000000027', 'Two-factor sign-in', 'Customers on a new device and all privileged staff sign in with two factors.', 'non_functional', 'must', 'approved', 'Sign-in without the second factor is refused', 'Cybersecurity and access', 'Nadia Rahman', 'Account takeover is the main channel threat.', 'test', 'security'),
